# Web Performance Audit

When asked to optimize performance, speed up this site/app, run a perf audit, or given a checklist covering things like caching, CDN, image compression, lazy loading, database indexing, or N+1 queries: read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root and follow its Detect -> Fix -> Verify process for each of the 20 checklist items.

Never mark an item done without a concrete check behind it (grep hit, response header, `EXPLAIN` output, bundle size delta, Lighthouse score). Report back using the evidence-per-item format `AGENTS.md` describes.
